igns that Macron wasn=E2=80=99t totally checked in.</span></p><p style=3D"f=
ont:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>When t=
housands of high school students took to the streets earlier this month pro=
testing funding cuts in education, the French president chose to spend the =
day on a warship off the coast of Brittany. As my colleague Mark Landler </=
span><a href=3D"https://nl.nytimes.com/f/newsletter/QK-cDXcZoFhsoz0mDIO9FA~=
